sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant X as Attacker<br/>on native VLAN
    participant S1 as Switch 1
    participant S2 as Switch 2
    participant V as Victim VLAN
    X->>S1: Frame with two 802.1Q tags<br/>outer = native, inner = victim
    Note over S1: Strips the outer tag<br/>and forwards on the trunk
    S1->>S2: Frame still carrying the inner tag
    Note over S2: Reads the inner tag as the VLAN
    S2->>V: Delivered into the victim VLAN
